<title>UK: Wilson Bowden sees profit rise in year.</title>
<headline>Wilson Bowden sees profit rise in year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property developer and housebuilder Wilson Bowden Plc said on Friday it was confident it will achieve a &quot;significant&quot; rise in full year profits.  </p>
<p>The company, which in March announced it was optimistic about prospects this year given market conditions, said that its expectations will be evidenced in half year figures.</p>
<p>Wilson made pre-tax profits of 41.0 million stg in 1996, nearly 39 percent higher than the previous year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
